cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this construction or its exact certificates, cite this repository."
title: "Quantile Cycles: Strict Cycles in Finite Quantile Control"
type: software
authors:
  - name: mottopanikeiku
repository-code: "https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/quantile-cycles"
url: "https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/quantile-cycles"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An explicit family of quantile-projected Bellman control operators with
  strict suboptimal two-cycles and no fixed points. The one-state construction
  covers every finite K>=2 and attracts every finite initial table modulo
  phase. Exact rational certificates and a Lean proof cover the smallest
  rational instance. In a 32-seed sampled study, quantile-Huber learning
  matched or beat scalar Q-learning on final-window regret.
